<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25182" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">jăcŭlum</span></b> , i,
			n.
		jaculus. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i>a dart, javelin</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">solem prae jaculorum multitudine et sagittarum
					non videbitis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. Tusc. 1, 42, 101</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">murum jaculo traicere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Fin. 4, 9, 22</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">has (litteras) ille in jaculo illigatas affert,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Caes.
					B. G. 5, 44</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">acutum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					M. 10, 130</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">torquere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Juv.
					5, 155</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">8,
			124</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fulminis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart. Cap. 2, § 151</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">radiorum solis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 1, § 13</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A net</i>, v. jaculus.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
